Error [E0326]: This pattern leaves out fields of `Incident`
  --> tests/ui/destructure_partial_missing_rest.jet:8:5
    |
  8 |     Incident{id, severity} :: Incident{id: 1, severity: 5, title: "boom"}
    |     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: A destructure that doesn't name every field must end with `..` so the skipped fields are visible at a glance
 Fix: Add `, ..` before the closing `}`, or name the remaining fields
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0326
